DISCLAIMER:

WaterTruth AI provides visual risk estimation only and does not chemically
test water. This system does not identify specific contaminants, bacteria,
or diseases. Results should not be used as a substitute for laboratory
testing or professional water quality analysis. Always follow local water
safety guidelines and regulations.

This software is not a medical device and is not regulated by the FDA, EPA,
or equivalent agencies. It is provided for informational and educational
purposes only. Users assume all risk for drinking water decisions based on
this software's output.
